{"title":"바보 같은 개일수록 사랑스러워 [19세 완전판]","thumbnail":null,"synopsis":"단순하고 둔해 빠진 녀석,하지만 엄청나게 야하고 귀여워♥정해진 거주지가 없고 무직인 와타누키 메구루는무일푼이 될 때마다 친구 타츠미 카나메의 집에서 신세를 진다.카나메를 좋아하지만 편안한 지금 관계를 깨지 않기 위해마음을 전할 생각이 전혀 없는 메구루는 어느 날,수상한 남자의 소개로 운반책 일을 하다실수를 해 수상한 약을 억지로 먹고 만다.몽롱한 상태로 집에 도착하지만달아오른 몸을 주체할 수 없었던 메구루는 잠든 카나메를 덮치는데…?[BABY COMICS]BAKANA INUHODO ITOOSHII©Yuitsu 2018All rights reservedFirst published in Japan in 2018 by FUSION PRODUCT Publishers Ltd., TokyoKorean version published by NEXCUBE, Inc.Under license from FUSION PRODUCT Publishers Ltd.","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-12","rank":236,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-26","rank":285,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-10-02","rank":279,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-10-27","rank":290,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}}],"weekly":[],"monthly":[]},"viewSeries":[],"metricsSeries":[{"date":"2026-10-11","v":25650,"rc":150,"rs":1476,"cc":14},{"date":"2026-10-12","v":25689,"rc":150,"rs":1476,"cc":14},{"date":"2026-10-13","v":25746,"rc":150,"rs":1476,"cc":14},{"date":"2026-10-14","v":25785,"rc":150,"rs":1476,"cc":14},{"date":"2026-10-15","v":25820,"rc":150,"rs":1476,"cc":14},{"date":"2026-10-16","v":25869,"rc":150,"rs":1476,"cc":14},{"date":"2026-10-17","v":25922,"rc":150,"rs":1476,"cc":14},{"date":"2026-10-18","v":25981,"rc":151,"rs":1486,"cc":14},{"date":"2026-10-19","v":26027,"rc":151,"rs":1486,"cc":14},{"date":"2026-10-20","v":26093,"rc":151,"rs":1486,"cc":14},{"date":"2026-10-21","v":26130,"rc":151,"rs":1486,"cc":14},{"date":"2026-10-22","v":26174,"rc":151,"rs":1486,"cc":14},{"date":"2026-10-23","v":26233,"rc":151,"rs":1486,"cc":14},{"date":"2026-10-24","v":26298,"rc":152,"rs":1496,"cc":14},{"date":"2026-10-25","v":26355,"rc":152,"rs":1496,"cc":14},{"date":"2026-10-26","v":26438,"rc":152,"rs":1496,"cc":14},{"date":"2026-10-27","v":26506,"rc":152,"rs":1496,"cc":14},{"date":"2026-10-28","v":26533,"rc":153,"rs":1506